# Optional build-time fallback for the OpenRouter key (client-side app).
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in YOUR OWN key. The key is embedded in the
# client bundle, so only use this for your own builds — never commit `.env`.
# The recommended path is entering the key in-app (System Core → OpenRouter API
# Key), which keeps it in your browser's localStorage only.
#
# VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-xxxx
